---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Services
description: Structured cabling, fiber, Wi-Fi drops, cameras and access control, AV, guest room technology, closet cleanup, and moves, adds, and changes.
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1 class="h1">Everything low voltage, one HEY.</h1>
    <p class="lede">If it carries data, video, or a signal through a building, we pull it, terminate it, test it, and label it. Here is what that covers.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="service-list">
      {% for s in site.services %}
      <article class="service" id="{{ s.slug }}">
        <div class="service__head">
          <h2 class="h3">{{ s.title }}</h2>
          <p class="service__short">{{ s.short }}</p>
        </div>
        <p class="service__text">{{ s.text }}</p>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="/say-hey/?service={{ s.slug }}">Price this</a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--white">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="h2">Every job ships with</h2>
    <ul class="proof">
      <li class="proof__item"><span class="proof__check">{% include "svg/icon-check.svg" %}</span><span>Certification results for every run, to category or fiber spec.</span></li>
      <li class="proof__item"><span class="proof__check">{% include "svg/icon-check.svg" %}</span><span>Labels at both ends and an as-built showing where everything goes.</span></li>
      <li class="proof__item"><span class="proof__check">{% include "svg/icon-check.svg" %}</span><span>A clean site. Ceiling tiles back, dust gone, nothing left in a hallway.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

